      "id": "flow_footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 1302,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 44,
      "text": "Mental model: the trainer app writes durable workout truth, the web app turns that truth into user-facing experiences, the mobile app reads through the web boundary, and the shared package prevents JS contract drift.",
